---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<div class="prose lg:prose-xl p-5 border-b-5 border-secondary">
		<h1>RCPCH Digital</h1>
	</div>
	<div class="prose p-5 border-b-5 border-secondary">
		<h2 class="mb-2">Join us</h2>
		<h3 class="text-accent">A new way to build technology for paediatrics and beyond.</h3>
		<p>
			We are looking for
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Developers and "clinicians who code"</li>
      <li>Healthcare professionals who want help building ideas</li>
      <li>RCPCH members to sit on our Digital Committee</li>
    </ul>
    <fieldset class="fieldset">
      <legend class="fieldset-legend">Email</legend>
      <input type="text" class="input" placeholder="example@rcpch.tech" />
      <legend class="fieldset-legend">Job Title</legend>
      <input type="text" class="input" placeholder="" />
      <legend class="fieldset-legend">How can we help?</legend>
      <textarea class="textarea h-24"></textarea>
      <p class="fieldset-label mt-0 mb-0">
        We will contact you to register on our <a href="https://forum.rcpch.tech/">forum</a>
      </p>
      <p class="fieldset-label mt-0 mb-0">
        We process your data in accordance with the <a href="https://www.rcpch.ac.uk/about-us/privacy-policy-website">RCPCH Privacy Policy</a>
      </p>
      <input type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" value="Register" />
    </fieldset>
	</div>
	<div class="prose p-5 border-b-5 border-secondary">
		<h2 class="mb-2">Growth Charts</h2>
		<h3 class="text-accent">The accurate, fast global standard</h3>
    <p>
		  Our interactive digital-native charts are easy to integrate and cost effective.
    </p>
    <p>
      Built and validated by the leading experts in the field, we provide free access to get started and for research.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://growth.rcpch.ac.uk/" target="_blank">See the demo</a>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://growth.rcpch.ac.uk/about/contact/" target="_blank">Contact us</a>
    </p>
	</div>
	<div class="prose p-5 border-b-5 border-secondary">
		<h2 class="mb-2">RCPCH Incubator</h2>
    <h3 class="text-accent">Take your ideas from concept to reality</h3>
    <p>
      We are a multi-disciplinary team of working clinicians, health professionals, developers and technologists.
      Our Incubator program operates like a startup accelerator, offering you advice and guidance on your digital projects.
      As a Royal College, we focus on those ideas the market can't or wont provide.
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Procurement</strong>: we advise on how to commission an effective, appropriate and resilient digital project.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Design</strong>: we help with requirements gathering and system design to ensure you get what you need, not just what your vendors suggest.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Development</strong>: we can build your project for you or help you find the right people.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Maintenance</strong>: we can host your projects and provide technical support.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">TODO MRB: call to action</a>
    </p>
	</div>
	<div class="prose p-5">
		<h2 class="mb-2">Clinical Audit Platform</h2>
    <h3 class="text-accent">Audit software your clinicians will love</h3>
    <p>
      Our web-based clinical audit platform is fast, modern and customisable. All data updates in real-time and our dashboarding
      framework focuses on what will help improve practice.
    </p>
    <p>
      It is API driven and ready to receive data directly from an EHR or other system.
      We develop open source and in the open on GitHub so there is no vendor lock in.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our platform has proven track record at national scale:
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Epilepsy12</strong>: running since January 2024
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>National Paediatric Diabetes Audit</strong>: running since April 2025
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">TODO MRB: call to action</a>
    </p>
	</div>
</Layout>
